    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-δάπᾰνος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[δᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing great
				expense</i> or <i>outlay,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.137
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			), cf.<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα</span>”
